    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tedious situation inevitably leads to the birth of an unstoppable problem solver. Are you gonna be the one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is yes, don\u2019t forget. In this test of wit, teamwork and quick thinking, there\u2019s no end to challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/90f274a666a6f815db1a811b56a42d98.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home we need, a home we build. Decorate every inch of your base with various furnitures, expressive art pieces and many electronic devices that goes \u201cBzzzzt!\u201d.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devices you built will come to your aid in your adventures in countless universes. Develop equipments, upgrade them and decide which ones you\u2019ll bring them your next quest. I\u2019ll say that one time. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/4a384f400edc7cf0e86f015f91994fc6.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your hardwork in your trophy section. Everyone needs to be aware of your unrivalled achievements. You can even adopt a pet when you earn enough experience points. Wouldn\u2019t it be great if you have a pet cat? Or a pet mouse? Or a pet\u2026 xenomorph?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/193d772357292082e2520420eb8c1d5f.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cosmic catastrophes to underwater disasters, insert every mission into their limits. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/c60d18901570928e11940e0745fbbf3b.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave a deadly meteor shower to retrieve valuable cargo from a space station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/945440c2dbb524f555a1cb8c63dd60ff.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evacuate a rapidly sinking submarine and save the crew before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/e10efd7f34323a9509448b01e0869383.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two trains on the way crashing into each other. No way to save every person? Just find one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0And More:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level brings fresh thrills and unforgettable challenges to prove your brilliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/06d3b31c51b9da8ab435654298e4fe69.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no place for solo workers in \u201cProblem Solved\u201d. Every player has a crucial role to play in each '<i>engineeral'</i> problem. You\u2019ll rise together or you\u2019ll fall together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why communication is the key to success. Use your radio as much as possible to direct your teammate\u2019s actions and give the necessary intel at the right time. But don\u2019t forget! You must use the radio station for it. No one can hear your screams if you\u2019re away from the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/dbeb0318b52c09b73f043e444643a858.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety is the name of the meal. Adrenaline is the side dish and unlimited rage is the desert. Do you believe your friends will be stay by your side after your first adventure? Do you think you have the courage to say \u201cLet\u2019s do one more?\u201d. Well. Let\u2019s find our, shall we?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/9130083002694856b1f1475d533bf3ce.avif?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tedious situation inevitably leads to the birth of an unstoppable problem solver. Are you gonna be the one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your answer is yes, don\u2019t forget. In this test of wit, teamwork and quick thinking, there\u2019s no end to challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/90f274a666a6f815db1a811b56a42d98.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home we need, a home we build. Decorate every inch of your base with various furnitures, expressive art pieces and many electronic devices that goes \u201cBzzzzt!\u201d.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devices you built will come to your aid in your adventures in countless universes. Develop equipments, upgrade them and decide which ones you\u2019ll bring them your next quest. I\u2019ll say that one time. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/4a384f400edc7cf0e86f015f91994fc6.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your hardwork in your trophy section. Everyone needs to be aware of your unrivalled achievements. You can even adopt a pet when you earn enough experience points. Wouldn\u2019t it be great if you have a pet cat? Or a pet mouse? Or a pet\u2026 xenomorph?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458900/extras/193d772357292082e2520420eb8c1d5f.webp?t=1737800437\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From cosmic catastrophes to underwater disasters, insert every mission into their limits. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 